		<h1>Kidnapped (<a href="/file/force%2Ctrue/id%2C13095/mode%2Cfile/">Kidnapped.txt</a>)</h1>
		<pre>Kidnapped
By Peter Kirsch
Published in SoftSide, vol. 4, no. 10, July 1981, pp. 34–45; corrections vol. 4, no. 11, August
1981, p. 22; vol. 5, no. 3, December 1981, p. 83
For Atari 400/800/XL/XE (same or very similar for Apple II and TRS-80)

Solution by Garry Francis
----------------------------------------
(This is a minimal solution. Verbs must be typed in full. For GET and DROP, only the first three
letters of the noun phrase are significant. For other actions, only the last three letters of the
noun phrase are significant.)

[Floor 9]
N
GET CHAIR
N
GET LONG BROOM
S
S
S
GET KEY
N
E
S
